{"server":"tw","storyId":"act17side_level_act17side_st10","groupId":"act17side","stageId":"act17side_09","title":"甲板室","storyCode":"SN-ST-10","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17side/level_act17side_st10.txt","sourceHash":"c166073a98e2067a8c8cc5a00c0059d40d23461fa900273079bc7898d6b986cf","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g25_goldenboat_core"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你浪費了機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是我，在鹽風城抓住那隻會說話的海嗣時，我會逼迫它說出它所知的關於阿戈爾的全部。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在陸地上行走了數年。你從未聽見過阿戈爾的訊息。但海洋不同，海洋從未斷絕過聯繫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就這麼放任它死去，沒有創造任何價值。低效的決策，歌蕾蒂婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"垃圾的訊息，我不需要。獵物給出的答案充斥著下級思維。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你在陸地上找到了幫手，並傾注了相當的信任。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（尖嘯）群星......墓地......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你手下留情了。他怎麼還站著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他只是比我想像中要更結實一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"騎士沒有還擊。他突然呆立在原地，隨後抬頭，蹣跚著，盤旋著，看著上方。\n歌蕾蒂婭本打算乘機結束這場追逐，但下一刻，她同樣產生了一股隱隱的預感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......海嗣的氣味，在變化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經敏銳到能捕捉到它們的變化了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就對了，歌蕾蒂婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論你怎麼安慰其他人和你自己，這才是我們遲早要面對的難題——我們自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g23_goldenboat_pass"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......加西亞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗚咽般的鳴叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......好......你讓它受了重傷！我們順著血跡找，我們很快就會回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，這些燒毀的痕跡是什麼？它對我的船做了什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......這不可能是那個怪物留下的痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說得對。這是我們可愛的伊比利亞小鳥留下的，多稀奇呀，在這短短的時間裡，她能成長到這樣的地步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海嗣和這樣的人誰比較可怕呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那個舊伊比利亞人？她？不可能，這艘船上隨便一個身經百戰的水手都比她要強。她怎麼能做到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕咬船長的袖子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論......無論那個舊伊比利亞人做了什麼，我們都得抓緊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該結束這場持續數月的狩獵了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您看上去有些高興，船長先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"高興？哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漫長的狩獵迎來了結局，誰會不高興？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們繼續追，我走另一條路。它鑿不穿這裡的牆壁......它會去更接近海的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加西亞......你的傷並不致命，堅強點，我們很快回來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"負傷的大副還需要時間恢復。它默默看著船長的臉。\n欣喜。難以掩飾的興奮。還有久違的活力。\n它放心地小睡片刻，集中精力恢復受傷的部分，以便幫助自己的愛人繼續狩獵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那是一個小小的夢境。短暫，恍惚，在肉體遭受巨大變化之後，這種情況就顯得尤為少見。\n夢裡，是伊比利亞的海岸。漫天的禮花和轟鳴的汽笛。意氣風發的阿方索站在它的身旁，問了它一個問題。\n加西亞。\n看見岸邊的那些孩子了嗎？我們都很喜歡孩子。\n孩子是伊比利亞的未來。我們的榮譽，戰功，一身本領，都會隨著生命消亡。\n但是，孩子，新的生命，伊比利亞共同養育的生命，會繼承這一切。\n加西亞。\n你覺得他該戴你我的哪頂帽子？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g22_goldenboat_hall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（受了傷還能這麼迅速地移動......追不上它！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（而且......勉強激發手炮......稍微有些......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"溟痕......連船上都......怎麼會？！剛才還沒有這麼嚴重！"},{"type":"narration","text":"螢光的溟痕吞噬著伊比利亞黃金的大廳。\n精緻的穹頂反射著幽藍色的光芒。在光芒的中央，站著一個格格不入的女性。\n她雙手交叉在前，沉默不語，細細打量著面前的王座。溟痕在她的腳下蔓延，黃金因她而失去色彩。\n她轉過頭。眼中只有慈憫與期待。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......晚上好，艾麗妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（深海教徒！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒砍到——？！不、不對！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石技藝？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"答對了，艾麗妮，如果達里奧看到你如今的模樣，一定會倍感欣喜吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——你為什麼知道我和長官的名字？你是誰？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是個翻譯家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種謊言你覺得還有意義嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從不說謊，艾麗妮。我翻譯了許多著作，也許你書架上的高盧批判現實主義小說，就是出自我手呢？你關注過翻譯的名字嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看你的腳下！溟痕是你帶來的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個說法稍有偏頗，並非是我帶來的溟痕......而是我，與發光的海洋建立了聯繫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很榮幸成為它的一部分，真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是怎麼登上這艘船的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不重要，艾麗妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是否能打敗海嗣，我是否會喪命於此，這艘船到底能不能成為與阿戈爾重建聯繫的關鍵，這些都不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊......達里奧與懲戒軍的犧牲，格蘭法洛的崩潰，伊比利亞之眼，漫長的時間......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在進化蛻變的浩瀚進程中，這一切都只是生命濺起的些微水花罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我尊重，是因為我們都只是其中一環。對於整體而言，則顯得微不足道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——等等。你說，長官，怎麼了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，可憐的艾麗妮......你看，我一直有問必答，但你真的需要在大敵當前的時候知道這種答案嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的犧牲毫無意義，艾麗妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海風帶來了他死亡的消息。我很遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能......不可能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒什麼不可能的，艾麗妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在神諭降下的時刻，這片大地的種種未來就都被確定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是匍匐於地的蟲子。我們應當順應命運。選擇一個沒有隔閡、沒有區別，不再有國家與形態之分的生命，又有什麼錯呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你如果放棄抵抗，那再好不過。可如果......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——如果真的有那麼無所謂，阿瑪雅，你就別幫那隻受傷的小獵物拖延時間呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勞倫緹娜，你醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還不完全，但起碼我已經記起你的名字來了，阿瑪雅。希望這不會顯得太失禮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"艾麗妮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......你對她做了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，只是一些閒談。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂。你去追吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"不是你的獵物嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰讓我看見了一位更令人懷念的人物呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，你小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"艾麗妮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你撒謊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海風不會撒謊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。我剛才就說，這是不可能的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長官的死一定是有意義的。審判庭不存在“無意義的犧牲”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你認為沒有，深海教徒......那麼我們會讓其意義得以展現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......真是堅強的孩子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"獵人，我們走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小艾麗妮......剛能掌握審判庭手炮的威力，就這麼顯擺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再這樣粗暴地燒毀溟痕，阿方索船長恐怕會暴跳如雷吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就這麼看著她們走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......我可不像昆圖斯那麼性急。同時面對兩位獵人，我的生命豈不是太短暫了些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一瞬間和一刹那有區別嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，但看見你變回以前的脾氣還真讓人懷念，勞倫緹娜。畢竟第一項實驗開始前，你一直都是昏迷狀態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"離開我們之後，你過得還好嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"幽靈鯊輕微笑了笑。\n這是她今晚最美的一次笑容。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g23_goldenboat_pass"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"它的速度在變快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經......哈啊......給它身上開了兩個洞了，它的血液是無窮的嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"兩個洞......你是怎麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個之後再說，我估計自己也沒剩多少力氣了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——它在一路捕食同類！難怪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"小心，它來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"——唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Ishar-mla，祂在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"答案，我想得到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪物！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"海嗣在艾麗妮激發手炮之前就俯下了身子。\n隨著牆壁的碎裂聲，借力回跳的斯卡蒂幾乎瞬間回到了海嗣的面前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"極限的一劍，仍舊落空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（竟然全都避開了？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不夠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"營養，時間，不夠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Ishar-mla，我們需要答案。但是，我能感到祂存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話語，我會討要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Ishar-mla，縱使沒有回答，不代表，祂不在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祂不在，亦不代表，族群，失去方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"方向，族群把握。我們，自行把握。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生存，唯一目標。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你們總是喜歡一邊嘀咕一邊廝殺嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"別想那麼複雜，也別打算回到海裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——還不夠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但，就快了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"——！捂上耳朵！艾麗妮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（尖銳的咆哮）——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g25_goldenboat_core"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沙啞的呢喃）羅辛——南特——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅辛南特","speakerId":"avg_npc_463_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘶鳴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巨浪將至，我們等待，我們去外面等待，武器，撕扯——我們走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅辛南特","speakerId":"avg_npc_463_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（呼應的嘶鳴）"},{"type":"narration","text":"遠處傳來海嗣的低鳴。歌蕾蒂婭微微皺眉。\n只是一個陸地人，魯莽地接觸大海，贏得了永恆的失心瘋，這並不難理解。\n那麼另一隻服從於他的海嗣？\n但歌蕾蒂婭並沒有細想。因為某種令人厭惡的預感正在刺激她的神經——\n——讓她脖頸發癢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在上面發生了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這艘船在海上漂了六十多年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果它們不願意見到這艘船，或者，它們執意要毀掉這艘船，把船上的人都當做敵人，那麼“愚人號”早就沉沒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以它們接納了它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們將這艘船視作了環境的一部分。無論出於什麼目的，它們一定允許這艘船存在於它們的海面上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在，情況不同了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"溟痕？什麼時候......這個速度......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這艘船的沉沒已經是板上釘釘的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歌蕾蒂婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有沒有想過，布雷奧甘這樣的阿戈爾人才，為什麼在最後一刻，選擇將鑰匙製成了“這個模樣”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這本該是阿戈爾夢寐以求的秘密的鑰匙，是他的心血結晶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那為什麼誰的血液都能打開它？為什麼他會任由鑰匙落入一個脆弱的騎士手中？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們讓那玩意兒閉了嘴。但他們可能根本不需要什麼神。只有脆弱虛偽的人類才會合攏雙手，向大海過多地祈禱，得到過多的慰藉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們爭取到的時間很有限，歌蕾蒂婭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"您還在想蒂亞戈的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，不完全是。在我所經歷的諸多悲劇之中，他沒有什麼值得特別在意的，就像沙灘上的沙子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是沙灘上，有多少沙子呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這艘船並非懲戒軍準備的。大部分船隻都被納入了懲戒軍的管轄，只有極少數......被忘記的，擱淺在岸邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"現在看上去，我們因為某位懲戒軍幕僚人員的粗心大意而省了不少功夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在想，我們會忘記多少東西，讓多少東西擱淺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希，如果泰拉大地是一艘船，你覺得是一艘怎樣的船？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......伊比利亞之眼就快到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
